From: xucy10 <xucy0609@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix region ticker disabling before plugins during shutdown

Issue #353: Region ticker disables before plugins, disallowing plugin
cleanups in the world.

During server shutdown, the RegionShutdownThread was waiting for the
scheduler (region ticker) to fully terminate BEFORE calling stopServer()
which disables plugins. This meant that when plugins tried to perform
world cleanup operations in their onDisable() handlers, the region ticker
was already fully halted and regions could no longer process tasks.

The fix reorders the operations in RegionShutdownThread.run() so that
stopServer() (which disables plugins) is called BEFORE waiting for the
scheduler to fully halt. Since the scheduler halt was already initiated
(non-blocking) by the initial stopServer() call from the main thread,
regions are still in the process of halting when plugins are disabled,
allowing plugin cleanup code to interact with the world.

diff --git a/lmili-server/src/minecraft/java/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/RegionShutdownThread.java b/lmili-server/src/minecraft/java/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/RegionShutdownThread.java
index f2208bcd..7b3c3a29 100644
--- a/lmili-server/src/minecraft/java/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/RegionShutdownThread.java
+++ b/lmili-server/src/minecraft/java/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/RegionShutdownThread.java
@@ -151,6 +151,13 @@ public final class RegionShutdownThread extends ca.spottedleaf.moonrise.common.u
 
     @Override
     public final void run() {
+        // Fix for issue #353: Region ticker disables before plugins, disallowing plugin cleanups in the world.
+        // The scheduler halt has already been initiated (non-blocking) by the initial stopServer() call
+        // from the main thread. We must call stopServer() here - which disables plugins - BEFORE waiting
+        // for the scheduler to fully terminate. This ensures plugins can still perform world cleanup
+        // operations while regions are in the process of halting (but not yet fully halted).
+        MinecraftServer.getServer().stopServer(); // stop part 1: most logic, kicking players, plugins, etc
+
         // await scheduler termination
         LOGGER.info("Awaiting scheduler termination for 60s...");
         if (TickRegions.getScheduler().halt(true, TimeUnit.SECONDS.toNanos(60L))) {
@@ -159,8 +166,6 @@ public final class RegionShutdownThread extends ca.spottedleaf.moonrise.common.u
             LOGGER.warn("Scheduler did not terminate within 60s, proceeding with shutdown anyways");
             TickRegions.getScheduler().dumpAliveThreadTraces("Did not shut down in time");
         }
-
-        MinecraftServer.getServer().stopServer(); // stop part 1: most logic, kicking players, plugins, etc
         // halt all chunk systems first so that any in-progress chunk generation stops
         LOGGER.info("Halting chunk systems...");
         for (final ServerLevel world : MinecraftServer.getServer().getAllLevels()) {
